    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Router D is compromised: NEVER use D.

    An authorised route starts
    at S, ends at V, follows directed links, and costs AT MOST 10 ms.


    Ask A
    for the route''s total latency T.

    SHIFT = T mod 5 (the remainder after dividing
    by 5).


    Decode STIR by shifting every letter BACKWARD by SHIFT in the alphabet;
    wrap A back to Z.

    ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ


    Set the decoder shift,
    validate the route, enter four letters, then both authorise for two seconds.'
